<div class="policy-page full-width">
  <div class="policy-page-inner">
    <h1 class="policy-page-title">{{ page.title | default: "Privacy Policy" }}</h1>
    <div class="policy-page-content">
      {% if page.content != blank %}
        {{ page.content }}
      {% elsif shop.privacy_policy.body != blank %}
        {{ shop.privacy_policy.body }}
      {% else %}
        <p><em>Last updated: August 2026</em></p>
        <p>At <strong>ARLENA Jewellery</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"), we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring your personal information is handled in a safe and responsible manner in accordance with the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs) and the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth).</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect personal information about you when you visit our website, place an order, create an account, or contact our customer care team. This includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Identity & Contact Data:</strong> Name, billing address, shipping address, email address, and phone number.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Data:</strong> Payment details (processed securely through encrypted payment gateways; we do not store full credit card numbers).</li>
          <li><strong>Transaction Data:</strong> Details about payments to and from you and other details of products you have purchased from us.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, time zone setting, operating system, and platform.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your personal information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Process, fulfill, and deliver your jewelry orders.</li>
          <li>Provide customer support, bespoke consultations, and warranty servicing.</li>
          <li>Send order confirmations, tracking updates, and delivery notifications.</li>
          <li>Communicate exclusive offers, new collection releases, and event invitations (you can opt out at any time).</li>
          <li>Prevent fraudulent transactions and enhance website security.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Sharing Your Information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We only share necessary data with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our business (e.g., Australia Post, FedEx, insured couriers, secure payment processors, and Shopify).</p>

        <h2>4. Data Security & Storage</h2>
        <p>We implement strict administrative, technical, and physical security measures to safeguard your personal data against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.</p>

        <h2>5. Your Rights & Contact</h2>
        <p>You have the right to access, update, or request deletion of your personal information. For any privacy inquiries, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@arlena.com.au">info@arlena.com.au</a> or via our <a href="/pages/contact">Contact Us page</a>.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .policy-page { background: #fff; min-height: 60vh; }
  .policy-page-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 130px 40px 80px; }
  .policy-page-title {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #111;
    margin-bottom: 35px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197, 168, 128, 0.3);
  }
  .policy-page-content { font-family: var(--font-base, 'Jost', sans-serif); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; color: #333; }
  .policy-page-content h2 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin: 32px 0 14px; color: #111; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .policy-page-content h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 10px; color: #222; }
  .policy-page-content p { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .policy-page-content a { color: #c5a880; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; font-weight: 500; }
  .policy-page-content ul, .policy-page-content ol { padding-left: 22px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .policy-page-content li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .policy-page-inner { padding: 100px 20px 60px; }
    .policy-page-title { font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Privacy Policy",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Privacy Policy" }]
}
{% endschema %}
